# Motion (Android)

Attach Motion only after `DeviceSessionState.STARTED`. Launch state, error, and sample collectors before `motion.start()`. Treat sensor values as nullable, handle `PAUSED`, stop and cancel collectors before `session.removeMotion()`, and use MockDevice recordings for deterministic tests. Motion has no runtime permission and is experimental.

